   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;C3C Image Size performs high-quality downsizing of raster images. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;The C3C algorithm provides colorimetrically correct color conversions and the best preservation of details, with adjustable and automatic sharpness. Works with 8-bit and 16-bit RGB and Grayscale images, layers, masks, and in Photoshop Actions.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Released in memory of the original author, Sergey Sverdlov.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;Maintained and enhanced by Alexey Danilchenko.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
   </property>
